{% doc %}
  A campaign price beside the normal one (SHO-169), as apps/web's OfferPrice.
  The struck price is what the item sells for outside the campaign, so it's a
  genuine comparison. Read as "Normally £24.95, Black Friday price £18.71".

  @param {number} normal - The normal price, in pence.
  @param {number} offer - The campaign price, in pence.
  @param {string} badge - The campaign's badge, e.g. "Black Friday".
{% enddoc %}
<s class="campaign-price__normal"
  ><span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'campaign.normally' | t }} </span>{{ normal | money }}</s
>
<span class="campaign-price__offer"
  ><span class="visually-hidden">, {{ 'campaign.badge_price' | t: badge: badge }} </span
  >{{- offer | money -}}</span
>
